          "author": "Raccoon Research Labs",
          "description": "Tune in to flights recently spotted by our network of junior air traffic controllers around the world and learn all about them and the faraway destinations they are headed.\n\nYoto Club Members should find this card in the Club Collection section of the Yoto app for their own personal scanner that finds jet planes in the skies around them.\n\nThis is a connected card, which means it requires an internet connection on your Yoto player to play. The card uses AI to create the live voice audio, but all content is from safe, professional sources and curated by humans.\n\nLearn more at dreamingofajetplane.com",
